# This directory is intentionally empty in source control.
#
# Third-party libraries (Eigen, mbedTLS, nghttp2, nlohmann/json) are treated
# as external dependencies. They are ignored by .gitignore and are fetched /
# built on demand by the project build script:
#
#     python build_apk.py
#
# The script detects whether each library is present and, if missing, obtains
# it via `git clone --depth 1 ...` (or other means) and runs a minimal compile
# test to verify it.
